          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations of the silent and parallel passage across the horizon of a glowing orange object with halo and light trail: likely observations of an atmospheric reentry.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "2fe12aaf070dfce1d2e205a20d71ad4c2ac63075d56df7ab47bc4c21740b433a"
